< {{uploadFile}}
------Upload05--

### 6) License Back - IDENTITY
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/documents/upload?document_type=IDENTITY
Authorization: Bearer {{driverKyc8Login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Upload06

------Upload06
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="license-back.pdf"
