### 7) Insurance - VEHICLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/documents/upload?document_type=VEHICLE
Authorization: Bearer {{driverKyc8Login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Upload07

------Upload07
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="vehicle-insurance.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{uploadFile}}
------Upload07--

### 8) PUC - VEHICLE
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/documents/upload?document_type=VEHICLE
Authorization: Bearer {{driverKyc8Login.response.body.$.token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----Upload08

------Upload08
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="puc-certificate.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< {{uploadFile}}
------Upload08--

### List uploaded docs (expect 8 new rows)
# @name driverKyc8List
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/drivers/documents
Authorization: Bearer {{driverKyc8Login.response.body.$.token}}

